<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs steady/weak - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were steady to weak. Demand and supplies were light to moderate. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  55.00-56.00 Few 56.50 &amp; 54.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  51.00-55.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  46.50-51.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $0.50. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00-44.50</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.50-46.00</p>
<p>		500-600 lbs. 47.00-51.00 Few over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>51.00-52.00</p>
</text>
